--- a/README.md
+++ b/README.md
@@ -21,6 +21,16 @@ The build will create two jar files:
 * the command line interface in the cli/target folder
 * the interactive explorer in the codeexplorer/target folder
 
+### Commands
+
+Run `java -jar sokrates.jar` without arguments to list all commands, and `java -jar sokrates.jar <command> -help` for details.
+
+* `init`: creates a new analysis configuration file
+* `generateReports`: generates the reports of an analysis
+* `analyzeLandscape`: the landscape counterpart of the analysis commands; creates or updates a landscape report aggregating the analyses found under `-analysisRoot`
+* `updateLandscape`: the same as `analyzeLandscape` (kept for existing scripts)
+* `updateConfig`: updates an analysis configuration file and completes missing fields
+
 ### Docker
 
